### Phase 6 - admin user management
@host = http://localhost:8080
@moderator = paste-moderator-token
@superAdmin = paste-super-admin-token
@user1 = paste-user1-token
@userId = 1
@userPostId = 1

### ---------- admin login ----------
POST {{host}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "your_admin_username",
  "password": "your_admin_password"
}

### ---------- admin user list / detail ----------

### 1. List users, search email/name, newest first -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users?q=rahul&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 2. List TEMP_BLOCKED users in one college -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users?status=TEMP_BLOCKED&collegeId=1&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 3. Detail: block fields, post counts, open reports, last 10 audit entries -> 200
### recentAudit items: id (String), actorType (ADMIN|SYSTEM), actorId, actorName,
### action, targetType, targetId, reason, metadata, createdAt.
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### ---------- TEMP block / unblock ----------

### 4. TEMP block -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "TEMP",
  "until": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "reason": "Repeated spam in listing titles."
}

### 5. The blocked user's token is rejected -> 403, message contains the end date
GET {{host}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}

### 6. Their APPROVED post is gone from the feed -> 200 without that post
GET {{host}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}

### 7. Admin detail shows HIDDEN + USER_BLOCKED for that post -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts?status=HIDDEN&q=your-post-title
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}

### 8. Unblock -> 200
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Appeal accepted after review."
}

### 9. The user token works again -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}

### 10. The post is back in the feed -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}

### 11. Unblock an ACTIVE user -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Already active."}

### ---------- PERM block ----------

### 12. Moderator cannot PERM block -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PERM",
  "reason": "Confirmed fraud and repeated policy violations."
}

### 13. Super admin PERM block -> 200, all their posts are deleted
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PERM",
  "reason": "Confirmed fraud and repeated policy violations."
}

### 14. Their posts are gone -> no rows for this user
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts?q=your-post-title
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdmin}}

### 15. Login now fails -> 403 permanently suspended
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "blocked-user@college.edu",
  "password": "their-password"
}

### 16. Moderator cannot PERM unblock -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Appeal accepted."}

### 17. Super admin PERM unblock -> 200 (deleted posts are NOT restored)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Appeal accepted."}

### ---------- validation / security ----------

### 18. Reason shorter than 5 characters -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "TEMP", "until": "2026-12-31T23:59:59Z", "reason": "x"}

### 19. TEMP block without until -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "TEMP", "reason": "Repeated spam."}

### 20. TEMP block with a past until -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/users/{{userId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{moderator}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "TEMP", "until": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z", "reason": "Repeated spam."}

### 21. User token on an admin route -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{user1}}